Kernel_setValidNonceFrom
├── when the caller is not the EntryPoint or self
│   └── it should revert with Unauthorized error
└── when the caller is the EntryPoint or self
    ├── when setting a new valid nonce from value
    │   └── it should update the validNonceFrom storage
    └── when validating nonces
        ├── given the nonce is below validNonceFrom
        │   └── it should be invalid
        └── given the nonce is at or above validNonceFrom
            └── it should be valid
